  "description": "OEDRO Floor Mats & Trunk Mat with Backrest for 2024–2026 Hyundai Santa Fe (Non-Hybrid) 6-Seater & 7-Seater Models. Designed with advanced TPE materials, these all-weather floor liners offer ultimate protection, anti-slip back seat coverage, and a perfect fit for gas-powered Hyundai Santa Fe SE, SEL, XRT, and Limited trims.\nFeatures\nPerfect Custom Fit: Engineered with advanced 3D laser scanning technology, these floor mats ensure a precise, glove-like fit for your 2024–2026 Hyundai Santa Fe (6- & 7-seater, non-hybrid). Designed to eliminate pedal interference for a safer and smoother drive.\nPremium Eco-Friendly Material: Made from GRS-certified, recyclable TPE, these durable mats are odorless, pet-friendly, and resistant to wear. Perfect for all weather conditions, they provide superior protection for your car's interior.\nStylish Yet Functional Design: Inspired by your vehicle's original aesthetics, the unique patterns seamlessly blend into your Hyundai Santa Fe’s interior while effectively trapping dirt, debris, and stains.\nUltimate Spill & Stain Containment: The edge-to-edge design offers complete coverage for your car’s floors and trunk. Effortlessly contain mud, snow, sand, and spills. Cleanup is quick—just remove, shake off, and rinse.\nUnmatched Durability & Quality: Crafted with precision and built to last, these mats provide reliable, long-lasting protection for your vehicle, even under tough conditions. Backed by OEDRO’s commitment to quality, they ensure consistent performance for years to come.\n2-Year Warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly Recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2024-2026 Hyundai Santa Fe 6 seat & 7 Seat.\nOnly fits the following Models: SE, SEL, Limited, and Calligraphy.\nNOT fit XL, Sport, or Hybrid Models.",
  "highlights": [
    "Premium Interior Protection: OEDRO Floor mats trap dirt, debris, and liquids to keep your vehicle floor clean and protected.",
    "Secure Driving Confidence: Anti-slip texture keeps mats firmly in place, helping ensure a safer and more stable ride.",
    "Built to Last: Durable, recyclable Thermoplastic Elastomer construction delivers long-term protection with easy maintenance."
  ],
